  "full_text": "I'm supposed to do an offering. How about I do a Moses comment? So, let's see. Moses says, wife, wife, let's see, let's see, let's see. The garbage disposal is broken. What? And the wife says, where are you going to throw the bodies? I don't know. I don't know. What? I don't know. What? Shut up. Let's see you do it. Because they had not executed my judgments, but had despised my statutes, and had polluted my sabbaths, and their eyes were after their father's idols. Wherefore I gave them also statutes that were not good, and judgments whereby they should not live. And I polluted them in their own gifts, in that they caused them to pass through the fire all that opened at the womb, that I might make them desolate to the end, that they might know that I am the Lord. Therefore, son of man, speak unto the house of Israel, saying to them, Thus saith the Lord God, Yet in this your fathers have blasphemed me, and that they have committed a trespass against me.",
